    "body": "7230 3.2.2 only puts the #-rule constraint on senders; recipients can combine headers without knowing their syntax.\r\n\r\nWRT structured headers, see https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/issues/596 and most recent text at the bottom of https://httpwg.org/http-extensions/draft-ietf-httpbis-header-structure.html#text",
